<title>NETHERLANDS: Nerefco Pernis refinery shut for two weeks in Sept.</title>
<headline>Nerefco Pernis refinery shut for two weeks in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pernis refinery of the BP-Texaco Nerefco joint venture is to close for maintenance for two weeks in September, a refinery spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is an entire shutdown of the refinery for 14 days,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>She declined to comment on when maintenance at the 220,000 barrel per day refinery will begin. Traders say they believe the start date will be September 5.</p>
<p>Production will be normal at Nerefco's neighbouring 200,000 bpd Europoort refinery.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
